    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware of Space Dragons is a short incremental experience about upgrading a space dragon from a small creature to the most powerful being in space. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dragon will automatically follow your mouse, guide it to collect resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686670/extras/fe86f67caabd674a5dd95d63203c1004.avif?t=1745960762\" width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat asteroids, stars and space derelict to gather XP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686670/extras/f34e8dd9c42dd3587527c483ecd518de.avif?t=1745960762\" width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the XP you got to buy upgrades in a big skilltree, such as more strength, size, XP gain, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686670/extras/a17ef99568a11a236978dcfaf548ec8e.avif?t=1745960762\" width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the greatest space dragon the cosmos has ever seen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686670/extras/a2837eb1489d40b3fb5505189638878d.avif?t=1745960762\" width=800 height=266 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware of Space Dragons is a short incremental experience about upgrading a space dragon from a small creature to the most powerful being in space. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dragon will automatically follow your mouse, guide it to collect resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686670/extras/fe86f67caabd674a5dd95d63203c1004.avif?t=1745960762\" width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat asteroids, stars and space derelict to gather XP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686670/extras/f34e8dd9c42dd3587527c483ecd518de.avif?t=1745960762\" width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the XP you got to buy upgrades in a big skilltree, such as more strength, size, XP gain, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686670/extras/a17ef99568a11a236978dcfaf548ec8e.avif?t=1745960762\" width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the greatest space dragon the cosmos has ever seen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686670/extras/a2837eb1489d40b3fb5505189638878d.avif?t=1745960762\" width=800 height=266 /></span></p>",
